Subject: [PATCH 3/4] [M156] [wgsl] Fix minBindingSize propagations

Original change's description:
> [wgsl] Fix minBindingSize propagations
>
> Buffer view and subgroup matrix both failed to use references for
> Hashmap::GetOrAddEntry results. This led to copies being made instead of
> actual updates. Correctly propagates to inspector now.
>
> Fix: 582845589
